pufferl: advantage normalization on (mean/var over the whole rollout)
pufferl: minibatch shuffle on (fresh permutation each training call)
pufferl: learning-reward clamp off (train.rew_clamp = 0.000)
pufferl: action hold 4 (resample every 4-th env step)
smart_buildings: canonical layout (983 obs, 219 continuous heads), absolute actions
smart_buildings: comfort shaping 2.000 (train-only potential, occupancy-free, gamma 0.990)
